<div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-3117/voodoo.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="voodoo.jpg" class="image" />
<div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;">
<p>GOC photograph; context unknown. Written on back: <tt>01/19/2005 FOUND HIDING IN CLOSET</tt></p>
